     install _p_o_r_t_s_/_x_1_1_-_d_r_i_v_e_r_s_/_x_f_8_6_-_i_n_p_u_t_-_e_g_a_l_a_x.

     To get the mouse working in X(7) (_p_o_r_t_s_/_x_1_1_/_x_o_r_g_-_d_o_c_s) in evdev mode, in‐
     stall _p_o_r_t_s_/_x_1_1_-_d_r_i_v_e_r_s_/_x_f_8_6_-_i_n_p_u_t_-_e_v_d_e_v.

FFIILLEESS
     uueepp creates a blocking pseudo-device file, _/_d_e_v_/_u_e_p_0 in native mode or
     _/_d_e_v_/_i_n_p_u_t_/_e_v_e_n_t_N in evdev mode.

